lib/hue/src/hue-roots.pem holds the public root certificates a Hue Bridge
presents, as published by Signify for local API clients. lib/hue's TLS client
is generated at build time from the Zig standard library's own (MIT), patched
to offer the cipher suite a Bridge needs; no copy of it is distributed here.

Hue is a trademark of Signify. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Signify, Nabu Casa or Silicon Labs.
